    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[**************************************

Springfield Devs
.NET MAUI - All kinds of questions - some of the answers
Presented By: Tiffany Ford

On May 23, 2022 the .NET Multi-platform App UI, or .NET MAUI, was released to general availability. But what is it?

In this presentation, I'm going to introduce you to this new cross-platform UI tool and I'll show you how it works. We will talk about the features and benefits, and give you lots of resources on how to get started. 

**************************************

View the stream on Twitch at https://www.twitch.tv/sgfdevs]]></Value>
    </description>
